From: SBE1V1K build <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] ref_misc: include ref_misc.h so the swconfig ops have prototypes

Linux 6.10 enabled -Wmissing-prototypes and qca-ssdk builds with
-Werror.  ref_misc.c defines the three qca_ar8327_sw_* swconfig
callbacks but never includes ref_misc.h, the header that declares them
(ssdk_init.c does include it).  Include it after <linux/switch.h> so
struct switch_dev/switch_attr/switch_val are already known.

src/ref/ref_misc.c:47:1: error: no previous prototype for
  'qca_ar8327_sw_set_max_frame_size' [-Werror=missing-prototypes]
src/ref/ref_misc.c:90:1: error: no previous prototype for
  'qca_ar8327_sw_get_max_frame_size' [-Werror=missing-prototypes]
src/ref/ref_misc.c:123:1: error: no previous prototype for
  'qca_ar8327_sw_reset_switch' [-Werror=missing-prototypes]

--- a/src/ref/ref_misc.c
+++ b/src/ref/ref_misc.c
@@ -37,6 +37,7 @@
 #include <linux/phy.h>
 #include <linux/netdevice.h>
 #include "ssdk_plat.h"
+#include "ref_misc.h"
 #include "ref_vlan.h"
 #ifdef MP
 #include <adpt.h>
